Subject: [PATCH] 09790: Preserve expanded variable storage and parent register
 alignment

Use shared variable storage resizing for unassociated
 variables

AI-generated by OpenAI Codex.

Use language endianness for standalone storage resizing

Derive byte order from ProgramArchitecture language and exercise the existing storage tests for both endian variants, including architecture-only scalar and register storage.

AI-assisted implementation and review using OpenAI Codex.
